    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d210-a1">

                <pb facs="0320" n="222" sameAs="frus:frus1920v01/pg222"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Enclosure—Translation<anchor n="81"
                            xml:id="d210-f1"/>]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Argentine Acting Minister of Foreign Affairs and
                        Worship</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Torello</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Buenos Aires</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-10-11"><hi rendition="#italic">October 11,
                        1920</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Mr. Secretary of State</hi>: I have the honor to
                    inform Your Excellency that the Government of Nicaragua has notified this
                    Ministry, through the note of which I enclose a certified copy, that the
                    Government of Nicaragua finds it no longer convenient to continue to be a party
                    to the Trade Mark Convention, concluded at the Fourth International American
                    Conference assembled in this capital in 1910, and finds itself in the position
                    of having to denounce it, as it does by means of the said note.</p>
                <p>Consequently, and in accordance with the stipulations of article 19 of the said
                    convention, I forward that document to Your Excellency for the notification and
                    information of Your Government.</p>
                <p>I avail myself [etc.]</p>
                <closer><signed>P[<hi rendition="#small-caps">ablo</hi>] <hi rendition="#small-caps"
                            >Torello</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
